<title>UK: Salomon sets warrants on Ciba Specialty Chemicals.</title>
<headline>Salomon sets warrants on Ciba Specialty Chemicals.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it has issued two million American-style call warrants on shares of Ciba Specialty Chemicals.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    120 CHF		   PREMIUM	23.45 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     15.80 CHF		 GEARING	6.96 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 28.MAR.97-17.JUL.98   PAYDATE	27.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  110 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
